  "label": "Vietnamese noodle soup",
  "description": "Pho is a traditional Vietnamese noodle soup that is widely popular in Vietnam and among Vietnamese communities abroad. It is typically made with rice noodles, broth, herbs, and meat (often beef or chicken). The text 'that pho was good!' implies the women have just eaten this dish and are expressing satisfaction, which requires background knowledge of what pho is and its cultural significance as a popular food item.",
